#!name=AppStore Monitor
#!desc=定时监控App Store内App的更新状态。\n可输入多个AppID，可自定义查询区域顺序（不填则为默认顺序），均以逗号分隔。\n可填入Bark Key使用Bark推送通知，若不填则默认使用Loon推送通知。\n可填入Bark Group分组名称，默认为空值，无分组。\n可选择Bark推送通知音效，默认值为system，使用系统默认提醒音效。
#!author=sooyaaabo[https://github.com/sooyaaabo]
#!icon=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sooyaaabo/IconLibrary/main/App/AppStore-02.png
#!category=功能增强, 定时任务
#!loon_version=3.5.3(1014)
#!homepage=https://loonlab.103516.xyz/Plugin/
#!date=2026-11-02 21:00
#!arguments=RunCron:"",app_ids:"",regions:"",bark_key:"",bark_group:"",bark_sound:"system"
#!arguments-desc=RunCron: 监控定时参数\n输入Cron表达式以启用定时运行\n\napp_ids: AppStore AppID\n输入需要监控的App ID\n\nregions: AppStore Region\n输入需要查询的区域代码\n\nbark_key: Bark Key\n输入Bark Key以启用Bark通知\n\nbark_group: Bark Group\n输入Bark Group设置消息推送分组\n\nbark_sound: Bark Sound\n选择需要的Bark通知音效\n可选值: system, alarm, anticipate, bell, birdsong, bloom, calypso, chime, choo, descent, electronic, fanfare, glass, gotosleep, healthnotification, horn, ladder, mailsent, minuet, multiwayinvitation, newmail, newsflash, noir, paymentsuccess, shake, sherwoodforest, silence, spell, suspense, telegraph, tiptoes, typewriters, update

[Script]
[AppStore Monitor]版本监控Task = type=cron, cronexp="{{{RunCron}}}", script-path=https://loon.103516.xyz/Script/AppStore/AppStoreMonitor.js, argument=app_ids="{{{app_ids}}}"&regions="{{{regions}}}"&bark_key="{{{bark_key}}}"&bark_group="{{{bark_group}}}"&bark_sound="{{{bark_sound}}}"

